888 |  * Grammar snippets are files (usually with extension |.Y|) contributed
889 |  * by various BIRD modules in order to provide information about syntax of their
890 |  * configuration and their CLI commands. Each snipped consists of several
891 |  * sections, each of them starting with a special keyword: |CF_HDR| for
