1686 | /**
1687 |  * protos_dump_all - dump status of all protocols
1688 |  *
1689 |  * This function dumps status of all existing protocol instances to the
1690 |  * debug output. It involves printing of general status information
1691 |  * such as protocol states, its position on the protocol lists
1692 |  * and also calling of a dump() hook of the protocol to print
1693 |  * the internals.
1694 |  */
