  1 | /*
  2 |  *	BIRD -- Forwarding Information Base -- Data Structures
  3 |  *
  4 |  *	(c) 1998--2000 Martin Mares <mj@ucw.cz>
  5 |  *
  6 |  *	Can be freely distributed and used under the terms of the GNU GPL.
