  1 | /*
  2 |  *	BIRD -- Multi-Threaded Routing Toolkit (MRT) Protocol
  3 |  *
  4 |  *	(c) 2017--2018 Ondrej Zajicek <santiago@crfreenet.org>
  5 |  *	(c) 2017--2018 CZ.NIC z.s.p.o.
